@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
autonumber

title Figure 4-3. Design Sequence: Get Delay Risk

actor "Traveler" as User
participant "Dashboard UI\n(Vue 3 + TypeScript)" as UI
participant "JourneyHandler\n(Gin)" as API
participant "Runtime" as RT
participant "advice.Agent" as AA
participant "MemoryStore" as Store
participant "SSEHub" as Hub

User -> UI : view delay risk
UI -> API : GET /api/v1/journey/{id}/state
API -> RT : GetSnapshot(id)
RT -> Store : GetSnapshot(id)
Store --> RT : JourneySnapshot (advice.risk included)
RT --> API : JourneySnapshot
API --> UI : 200 OK + JourneySnapshot
UI --> User : render advice.risk, reasons and state.updatedAt

== risk evaluation (inside asynchronous recalculation) ==
RT -> AA : Evaluate(state, progress, issues, departureIATA, hasBaggage, now)
AA -> AA : ComputeTimeFacts:\nminutesUntilGateClose from timeline (gate-close node, else departure)\nbufferMin = minutesUntilGateClose - etaMin (skip etaMin at the airport)
AA -> AA : map bufferMin to risk\n(>= 90: green, 30..90: yellow, 0..30: orange, < 0: red)
alt key data missing
  alt no flightStatus and no timeline
    AA -> AA : risk = unknown; drop nav actions and actions that only restate missing data
  else partial data
    AA -> AA : cap risk at yellow (never green); list missing items in reasons
  end
end
note over AA
  one failing source never fails the whole analysis;
  issues are merged into advice.reasons
end note
AA --> RT : Advice (stage, risk, alert, cards, reasons)
RT -> Store : SaveSnapshot(snapshot)
RT -> Hub : Publish(id, snapshot)
Hub --> UI : event: snapshot
UI --> User : updated risk level and reasons

@enduml
